==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|с-|ходи́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сходи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сходить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сходи́ть|impf|pf=сойти́}}

# to [[go down]], to [[come down]], to [[descend]], to [[get off]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''сходи́ть''' [[с]] [[ум|ума́]]|t=to go crazy}}
# to [[come off]], to [[disappear]]
# to [[pass by]]
# to [[pass for]], to be taken for
# to [[drift]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|4c|сходи́ть}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|схо́дни|g=p}}
''Compounds:''
* {{l|ru|сходи́ть на нет|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|сойти́ на нет|g=pf}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сходи́ть|pf}}

# to [[go]] and [[get]], to [[fetch]] {{+obj|ru|:за(ins)<something>}}
#: {{ux|ru|Вале́р, '''сходи́'''[[-ка]] [[за]] [[молоко|молоко́м]].|t=Valera, go and get some milk, will you?}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf-intr|4c|сходи́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сходи́ть|pf|impf=ходи́ть}}

# to [[go]] and [[come back]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Мне]] [[ну́жно]] '''сходи́ть''' [[в]] [[банк]].|t=I need to go to the bank (and come back).}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf-intr|4c|сходи́ть}}

===Related terms===
* {{l|ru|сходи́ться|g=impf}}
